---
// Literal recreation of the Claude Design canvas's Admin Order Detail
// screen. No distinct "AdminOrderDetail.dc.html" artboard exists in the
// design export (same situation as Admin Sales Orders) — the ground truth
// is project/PageOrderDetail.dc.html's own `role="admin"` branch, composed
// into the same Admin shell already established by Admin Customers/Admin
// Sales Orders: NavSidebar role="admin" (unchanged) + the plain shared
// NavTop.astro (not AdminNavTop.astro) + PageOrderDetail's isAdmin
// content. project/SalesOrderDetail.dc.html (NavSidebar role="sales" +
// PageOrderDetail role="sales") is the sibling composition already built
// as /sales/orders/[id].astro (untouched this turn) — that page already
// implements the real, role-correct order-action authorization
// (advance/cancel/refund-request) independent of which shell it's
// rendered in, since it reads Astro.locals.role directly rather than a
// hardcoded "sales" assumption. This screen reuses that exact same real
// orders/order_items/payments query shape and the exact same real
// updateOrderStatus/requestApproval Astro Actions, rendered inside the
// Admin shell instead, with the design's genuine isAdmin-only extras
// (a real "Placed by" field) reproduced where real data supports them —
// per this turn's own explicit instruction ("orders.placed_by is an
// audit/process field... use an honest label such as 'Placed by' if the
// design contains an equivalent field and the real value is available").
// IMPORTANT: this page is NOT linked to/from /sales/orders/[id] — it is a
// separate, self-contained Admin-shell route, never a redirect or reuse of
// the Sales-shell page, per your explicit instruction.
//
// Real vs deferred/fabricated, per your explicit no-fabrication rules:
//  - Real: order id (truncated UUID), real payment-status pill and
//    fulfilment-status pill (full 7-value order_status enum), real
//    customer name/phone (profiles), real line items (SKU/name/qty/unit
//    price/line subtotal from order_items+products), real item/unit
//    counts, real Subtotal/Tax/Shipping/Total exactly as stored (this
//    app's tax/shipping are genuinely 0 by design — shown as such, no
//    invented 18% GST or "Free" shipping), real shipping address
//    (orders.shipping_address.formatted — the address actually used for
//    THIS order), real payment method/status/amount/paid_at, real order
//    notes (orders.notes — the customer's own checkout note, read-only).
//  - "Sales staff: Arjun Mehta" row -> relabeled "Placed by": real, and
//    computed exactly like the Admin Sales Orders list's own Placed-by
//    column — "Customer" when orders.placed_by equals the order's own
//    customer_id (self-checkout via place_order()'s real auth.uid()
//    behavior), otherwise the real staff profile's name. Never shown as
//    "Sales staff"/ownership per this project's explicit warning.
//  - Real status actions restricted to exactly what the signed-in
//    admin/super_admin is authorized to do today (identical underlying
//    logic to /sales/orders/[id].astro, just re-derived inline): advance
//    to the next legal status; a direct cancel for super_admin or a
//    request-approval cancel (updateOrderStatus / requestApproval
//    'cancel_paid_order') for admin; the same real requestApproval
//    'refund_payment' control for a cancelled+paid order, shown only to
//    admin (super_admin approves, doesn't request — same real
//    can-request rule already proven on the Sales page). The design's
//    admin-only "Cancel order" header button is replaced by these real,
//    role-correct controls (same disclosed deviation already approved on
//    Sales Order Detail — the true authorization source is viewerRole +
//    order status, not the design's blanket isAdmin gate). "Print order"
//    is real (window.print()) — genuinely present in the design for both
//    roles, not gated, so kept; no print behavior was added beyond what
//    the design/already-approved Sales page already has.
//  - "Download" (PDF/invoice) header button: no export capability exists
//    anywhere in this app — omitted, not invented.
//  - "Bin"/"Shipped" columns, the header's fabricated shipment narrative,
//    and the "Shipment" card (carrier/AWB/parcel weight/"Track parcel"/
//    5-step dated tracker): no warehouse-bin field, no per-item partial-
//    shipment tracking, and no carrier/tracking data exist anywhere in
//    the schema — all omitted. Replaced with the same honest 5-step
//    status tracker already approved on the Sales/Customer Order Detail
//    pages, driven only by the real order.status; a cancelled/refunded
//    order gets a plain status banner instead.
//  - "Billing address" / GSTIN: no separate per-order billing address, no
//    tax-id field anywhere in the schema — omitted.
//  - "Gross margin" card: admin-only in the design, but needs a real
//    product-cost field that doesn't exist (products only stores selling
//    price) — omitted, never fabricated.
//  - "Support tickets for this order" link: admin-only in the design, but
//    support_tickets has no order_id column at all (confirmed already on
//    the Sales Order Detail and Support Ticket Detail screens) — omitted.
//  - "Internal notes" card: the design shows a fabricated existing note
//    with an invented author/date plus a free-text add-note input. There
//    is no order_notes table and no real write path for staff notes on an
//    order — inventing one would need a new migration, not authorized
//    this turn. The one real, read-only equivalent (orders.notes, the
//    customer's own checkout note) is shown instead, honestly labelled,
//    with no add-note input — identical treatment to the Sales page.
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import NavSidebar from "../../../components/staff/NavSidebar.astro";
import NavTop from "../../../components/staff/NavTop.astro";
import type { OrderStatus } from "../../../lib/types";

const { id } = Astro.params;
const viewerRole = Astro.locals.role;
const navViewerRole = (viewerRole === "super_admin" ? "super_admin" : "admin") as "admin" | "super_admin";

const { data: order } = await Astro.locals.supabase
  .from("orders")
  .select("id, customer_id, placed_by, status, subtotal, tax, shipping_fee, total, shipping_address, notes, created_at")
  .eq("id", id)
  .maybeSingle();

if (!order) {
  Astro.response.status = 404;
}

const { data: customer } = order
  ? await Astro.locals.supabase.from("profiles").select("full_name, phone").eq("id", order.customer_id).maybeSingle()
  : { data: null };

let placedByName: string | null = null;
if (order?.placed_by && order.placed_by !== order.customer_id) {
  const { data: placer } = await Astro.locals.supabase.from("profiles").select("full_name").eq("id", order.placed_by).maybeSingle();
  placedByName = placer?.full_name ?? null;
}
const placedByLabel = order ? (order.placed_by === order.customer_id ? "Customer" : (placedByName ?? "—")) : "—";

const { data: itemRows } = order
  ? await Astro.locals.supabase
      .from("order_items")
      .select("id, quantity, unit_price, subtotal, products(sku, name)")
      .eq("order_id", id)
  : { data: null };

function productOf(row: { products: unknown }): { sku: string; name: string } | null {
  return row.products as unknown as { sku: string; name: string } | null;
}

const { data: payment } = order
  ? await Astro.locals.supabase.from("payments").select("id, status, method, paid_at").eq("order_id", id).maybeSingle()
  : { data: null };

const items = itemRows ?? [];
const totalUnits = items.reduce((sum, i) => sum + i.quantity, 0);

const formatCurrency = (value: number) =>
  new Intl.NumberFormat("en-IN", { style: "currency", currency: "INR", maximumFractionDigits: 2 }).format(value);
const formatDate = (value: string) =>
  new Date(value).toLocaleDateString(undefined, { day: "numeric", month: "short", year: "numeric" });

const STATUS_TONE: Record<OrderStatus, "outline" | "warn" | "info" | "success" | "muted"> = {
  pending: "outline",
  confirmed: "warn",
  processing: "warn",
  shipped: "info",
  delivered: "success",
  cancelled: "muted",
  refunded: "muted",
};
const STATUS_LABEL: Record<OrderStatus, string> = {
  pending: "Pending",
  confirmed: "Confirmed",
  processing: "Processing",
  shipped: "Shipped",
  delivered: "Delivered",
  cancelled: "Cancelled",
  refunded: "Refunded",
};
const PAY_TONE: Record<string, "success" | "warn" | "danger" | "muted"> = {
  paid: "success",
  pending: "warn",
  failed: "danger",
  refunded: "muted",
};
const PAY_LABEL: Record<string, string> = { paid: "Paid", pending: "Unpaid", failed: "Failed", refunded: "Refunded" };
const PAY_METHOD_LABEL: Record<string, string> = { upi: "UPI", card: "Card", bank_transfer: "Net banking", cash: "Cash on delivery" };

const FORWARD_STATUSES = ["pending", "confirmed", "processing", "shipped", "delivered"];
const currentIndex = order ? FORWARD_STATUSES.indexOf(order.status) : -1;
const isTerminalOffRamp = order ? order.status === "cancelled" || order.status === "refunded" : false;
const TRACKER_STEPS = [
  { key: "pending", label: "Placed" },
  { key: "confirmed", label: "Confirmed" },
  { key: "processing", label: "Processing" },
  { key: "shipped", label: "Shipped" },
  { key: "delivered", label: "Delivered" },
];

// --- Real status-action authorization — identical logic to
// /sales/orders/[id].astro, re-derived inline so the markup below can be
// styled fresh for the Admin shell.
const nextStatus: Record<string, string> = { pending: "confirmed", confirmed: "processing", processing: "shipped", shipped: "delivered" };
const canAdvance = !!order && order.status in nextStatus;
const canCancel = !!order && ["pending", "confirmed", "processing"].includes(order.status);
const canDirectCancel = viewerRole === "super_admin";
const canRequestRefund = viewerRole === "sales_staff" || viewerRole === "admin";
const canShowRefundControl = !!order && canRequestRefund && order.status === "cancelled" && payment?.status === "paid";
---

<BaseLayout title={order ? `Order ${order.id.slice(0, 8)} — Admin` : "Order not found — Admin"}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" />
  </Fragment>

  <div class="sd" id="sd-root">
    <div id="sd-sidebar-backdrop" class="sd__backdrop"></div>

    <div id="sd-sidebar" class="sd__sidebar">
      <NavSidebar active="Sales orders" role="admin" viewerRole={navViewerRole} />
    </div>

    <div class="sd__panel">
      <NavTop section="Sales" parent="Sales orders" page={order ? order.id.slice(0, 8) : "Not found"} />

      <main id="main-content" class="aod__main">
        {
          order ? (
            <Fragment>
              <div class="aod__topbar">
                <a href="/admin/orders" class="aod__back aod__no-print">
                  <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path></svg>
                  Sales orders
                </a>
                <div class="aod__header">
                  <div class="aod__heading-col">
                    <div class="aod__heading-row">
                      <h1>{order.id.slice(0, 8)}</h1>
                      {payment && <span class={`aod__pill aod__pill--${PAY_TONE[payment.status] ?? "muted"}`}>{PAY_LABEL[payment.status] ?? payment.status}</span>}
                      <span class={`aod__pill aod__pill--${STATUS_TONE[order.status as OrderStatus] ?? "muted"}`}>{STATUS_LABEL[order.status as OrderStatus] ?? order.status}</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="aod__meta">{customer?.full_name ?? "Unnamed customer"} · placed {formatDate(order.created_at)}</span>
                  </div>
                  <div id="order-status-actions" data-order-id={order.id} data-cancel-mode={viewerRole === "super_admin" ? "direct" : "request"} class="aod__actions aod__no-print">
                    {canAdvance && (
                      <button type="button" data-action="advance" data-next-status={nextStatus[order.status]} class="aod__btn aod__btn--primary">
                        Mark as {STATUS_LABEL[nextStatus[order.status] as OrderStatus]}
                      </button>
                    )}
                    {canCancel && (
                      <button type="button" data-action="cancel" class="aod__btn aod__btn--danger">
                        {canDirectCancel ? "Cancel order" : "Request cancellation"}
                      </button>
                    )}
                    <button type="button" id="aod-print-btn" class="aod__btn">
                      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 8V3h10v5M7 17H4v-9h16v9h-3M7 14h10v7H7z" /></svg>
                      Print order
                    </button>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <p id="status-message" class="aod__status-message aod__no-print" role="status" />
              </div>

              <div class="aod__body">
                <div class="aod__left">
                  <section class="aod__panel-card">
                    <div class="aod__panel-head">
                      <span class="aod__panel-title">Line items</span>
                      <span class="aod__panel-sub">{items.length} item{items.length === 1 ? "" : "s"} · {totalUnits} unit{totalUnits === 1 ? "" : "s"}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="aod__grid aod__grid-head">
                      <span>SKU</span><span>Item</span><span class="aod__col-right">Qty</span><span class="aod__col-right">Price</span><span class="aod__col-right">Total</span>
                    </div>
                    {items.map((item) => (
                      <div class="aod__grid aod__row">
                        <span class="aod__muted-cell">{productOf(item)?.sku ?? "—"}</span>
                        <span class="aod__item-name">{productOf(item)?.name ?? "—"}</span>
                        <span class="aod__col-right">{item.quantity}</span>
                        <span class="aod__col-right aod__muted-cell">{formatCurrency(item.unit_price)}</span>
                        <span class="aod__col-right aod__item-total">{formatCurrency(item.subtotal)}</span>
                      </div>
                    ))}
                    <div class="aod__totals">
                      <div class="aod__totals-row"><span>Subtotal</span><span>{formatCurrency(order.subtotal)}</span></div>
                      <div class="aod__totals-row"><span>Tax</span><span>{formatCurrency(order.tax)}</span></div>
                      <div class="aod__totals-row"><span>Shipping</span><span>{formatCurrency(order.shipping_fee)}</span></div>
                      <div class="aod__totals-row aod__totals-final"><span>Total</span><span>{formatCurrency(order.total)}</span></div>
                    </div>
                  </section>

                  {isTerminalOffRamp ? (
                    <section class="aod__status-banner aod__no-print">
                      <span class={`aod__pill aod__pill--${STATUS_TONE[order.status as OrderStatus] ?? "muted"}`}>{STATUS_LABEL[order.status as OrderStatus] ?? order.status}</span>
                      <span>{order.status === "cancelled" ? "This order was cancelled." : "This order was refunded."}</span>
                    </section>
                  ) : (
                    <section class="aod__panel-card aod__tracker-card aod__no-print">
                      <span class="aod__panel-title">Order status</span>
                      <div class="aod__steps">
                        {TRACKER_STEPS.map((step, i) => {
                          const done = currentIndex >= i;
                          const isLast = i === TRACKER_STEPS.length - 1;
                          return (
                            <div class="aod__step">
                              <div class="aod__step-row">
                                <span class={`aod__step-dot ${done ? "is-done" : ""}`}>
                                  {done && <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-10" /></svg>}
                                </span>
                                {!isLast && <span class={`aod__step-line ${currentIndex > i ? "is-done" : ""}`} />}
                              </div>
                              <div class="aod__step-label-col">
                                <span class={`aod__step-label ${done ? "is-done" : ""}`}>{step.label}</span>
                                {step.key === "pending" && <span class="aod__step-date">{formatDate(order.created_at)}</span>}
                              </div>
                            </div>
                          );
                        })}
                      </div>
                    </section>
                  )}
                </div>

                <div class="aod__right">
                  <section class="aod__side-card">
                    <div class="aod__customer-head">
                      <span class="aod__avatar aod__no-print">
                        {(customer?.full_name ?? "?").split(" ").filter(Boolean).slice(0, 2).map((p: string) => p[0]!.toUpperCase()).join("")}
                      </span>
                      <div class="aod__customer-identity">
                        <span class="aod__customer-name">{customer?.full_name ?? "Unnamed customer"}</span>
                        <span class="aod__customer-sub">{customer?.phone ?? "No phone on file"}</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="aod__divider" />
                    <div class="aod__field-col">
                      <span class="aod__field-label">Shipping address</span>
                      <span class="aod__field-value">{(order.shipping_address as { formatted?: string } | null)?.formatted ?? "No address on file."}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="aod__divider" />
                    <div class="aod__kv-row">
                      <span class="aod__field-label">Placed by</span>
                      <span class="aod__kv-value">{placedByLabel}</span>
                    </div>
                  </section>

                  <section class="aod__side-card">
                    <div class="aod__side-head-row">
                      <span class="aod__panel-title">Payment</span>
                      {payment && <span class={`aod__pill aod__pill--${PAY_TONE[payment.status] ?? "muted"}`}>{PAY_LABEL[payment.status] ?? payment.status}</span>}
                    </div>
                    <dl class="aod__dl">
                      <div class="aod__dl-row"><dt>Amount</dt><dd>{formatCurrency(order.total)}</dd></div>
                      <div class="aod__dl-row">
                        <dt>Method</dt>
                        <dd>
                          {payment ? (PAY_METHOD_LABEL[payment.method] ?? payment.method) : "—"}
                          {payment?.paid_at && <Fragment> · {new Date(payment.paid_at).toLocaleString()}</Fragment>}
                        </dd>
                      </div>
                    </dl>
                    {canShowRefundControl && (
                      <div class="aod__refund aod__no-print" id="refund-control" data-payment-id={payment!.id}>
                        <button type="button" id="request-refund-btn" class="aod__btn aod__btn--danger aod__btn--full">Request refund</button>
                        <p id="refund-message" class="aod__status-message" role="status" />
                      </div>
                    )}
                  </section>

                  {order.notes && (
                    <section class="aod__side-card aod__no-print">
                      <span class="aod__panel-title">Order notes</span>
                      <div class="aod__note-box">
                        <span class="aod__note-text">{order.notes}</span>
                        <span class="aod__note-meta">From the customer at checkout</span>
                      </div>
                    </section>
                  )}
                </div>
              </div>
            </Fragment>
          ) : (
            <div class="aod__notfound">
              <p class="aod__notfound-title">Order not found</p>
              <p class="aod__notfound-body">This order may not exist.</p>
              <a href="/admin/orders" class="aod__btn">Back to Sales orders</a>
            </div>
          )
        }
      </main>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .sd {
    --sd-shell: #fafafa;
    --sd-panel: #ffffff;
    --sd-card: #ffffff;
    --sd-fg: #0a0a0a;
    --sd-fg2: #404040;
    --sd-muted: #f5f5f5;
    --sd-muted-fg: #737373;
    --sd-border: #e5e5e5;
    --sd-input: #e5e5e5;
    --sd-primary: #171717;
    --sd-primary-fg: #fafafa;
    --sd-success-bg: #ecfdf3;
    --sd-success-fg: #15803d;
    --sd-warn-bg: #fef3e2;
    --sd-warn-fg: #9a3412;
    --sd-danger-bg: #feecec;
    --sd-danger-fg: #b91c1c;
    --sd-info-bg: #eef2ff;
    --sd-info-fg: #3538cd;
    --sd-accent: #2b50e0;
    --sd-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    color-scheme: light;

    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    background: var(--sd-shell);
    color: var(--sd-fg);
    font-family: "Geist", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .sd[data-theme="dark"] {
    --sd-shell: #0a0a0a;
    --sd-panel: #0f0f0f;
    --sd-card: #171717;
    --sd-fg: #fafafa;
    --sd-fg2: #d4d4d4;
    --sd-muted: #262626;
    --sd-muted-fg: #a3a3a3;
    --sd-border: #262626;
    --sd-input: #363636;
    --sd-primary: #fafafa;
    --sd-primary-fg: #171717;
    --sd-success-bg: #0f2a1c;
    --sd-success-fg: #4ade80;
    --sd-warn-bg: #2e1f0e;
    --sd-warn-fg: #fdba74;
    --sd-danger-bg: #2d1414;
    --sd-danger-fg: #f87171;
    --sd-info-bg: #1e2240;
    --sd-info-fg: #a5b4fc;
    --sd-accent: #6b8afb;
    --sd-shadow: none;
    color-scheme: dark;
  }
  .sd__backdrop {
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    z-index: 20;
  }
  .sd__sidebar {
    height: 100vh;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .sd__sidebar {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      z-index: 30;
      transform: translateX(-100%);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }
    .sd__sidebar.is-open {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
    .sd__backdrop.is-open {
      display: block;
    }
  }
  .sd__panel {
    flex-grow: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin: 8px 8px 8px 0;
    background: var(--sd-panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--sd-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--sd-shadow);
  }
  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .sd__panel {
      margin: 8px;
    }
  }

  .aod__main {
    flex-grow: 1;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 24px 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .aod__main {
      padding: 16px;
    }
  }

  .aod__topbar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .aod__back {
    align-self: flex-start;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--sd-muted-fg);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .aod__header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .aod__heading-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .aod__heading-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .aod__heading-row h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }
  .aod__meta {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--sd-muted-fg);
  }
  .aod__pill {
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .aod__pill--outline {
    border: 1px solid var(--sd-input);
    color: var(--sd-fg);
  }
  .aod__pill--warn {
    background: var(--sd-warn-bg);
    color: var(--sd-warn-fg);
  }
  .aod__pill--info {
    background: var(--sd-info-bg);
    color: var(--sd-info-fg);
  }
  .aod__pill--success {
    background: var(--sd-success-bg);
    color: var(--sd-success-fg);
  }
  .aod__pill--danger {
    background: var(--sd-danger-bg);
    color: var(--sd-danger-fg);
  }
  .aod__pill--muted {
